      <p>Wednesday delivers a blockbuster programme with up to nine gold medals on offer. Alpine Skiing takes centre stage as the Women's Downhill races on the legendary Tofana course in Cortina d'Ampezzo. The Women's Luge Singles concludes with Runs 3 &amp; 4, while Ski Jumping stages the Women's Normal Hill Final in Predazzo. Short Track Speed Skating ignites with the Men's 1000m Final in Milan, Biathlon delivers the Men's 10 km Sprint in Anterselva, and Freestyle Skiing crowns the Women's Aerials champion. Cross-Country Skiing features the Men's Skiathlon, and Speed Skating races the Women's 3000m.</p>
